# The AI trader's monthly deep review (human ruling 2026-11-13, item 1): on a
# month's first session, after the close, the prior month is reviewed (every
# trade, timing, clusters, the shadows, the live mirror, the A/B and the
# learning loop; the model's diagnosis and ranked proposals, each with its
# evidence and a shadow test) and posted to #reports. Proposals wait for a
# human ruling; nothing applies on its own.
#
# The command decides: outside a month's first five sessions, or once the
# month's review has been sent (a marker under ~/agentic-scratch/reviews), it
# exits at once. Read-only against every ledger; writes only the scratch
# report and marker. LLM spend: one forced-tool call (~$0.2-0.5).
#
# Not named agentic-lab-*: it is no lab account's unit and owns no data tree.
# Register with:
#   sudo cp ops/vps/agentic-ai-review.{service,timer} /etc/systemd/system/
#   sudo systemctl daemon-reload
#   sudo systemctl enable --now agentic-ai-review.timer
[Unit]
Description=Agentic AI trader monthly review (first session of each month, after the close)
After=network-online.target
Wants=network-online.target

[Service]
Type=oneshot
User=agentic
WorkingDirectory=/home/agentic/Agentic
Environment=PYTHONIOENCODING=utf-8
ExecStart=/home/agentic/Agentic/.venv/bin/python -m lab monthly-review --scheduled
MemoryMax=600M
MemorySwapMax=0
OOMScoreAdjust=500
Nice=10
TimeoutStartSec=1h
